OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween party rapist jailed for
OL,4,Aattack on sleeping teen
OL,5,
OL,6,FNtolakai, 23, of Manston Road,
OL,7,FRamsgate, was sentenced, to five years
OL,8,Fand seven months' imprisonment and
OL,9,Fplaced on the sex offenders register
OL,10,Ffor life, on Thursday 17 September at
OL,11,FCanterbury Crown Court.
